/plans/2026-09-19-phase-0-1-bootstrap-and-jira-tracker.md:3156:\t\tfmt.Fprintln(stderr, err)\ndocs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-19-phase-0-1-bootstrap-and-jira-tracker.md:3161:\t\tfmt.Fprintln(stderr, \"jira check failed:\", err)\ndocs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-19-phase-0-1-bootstrap-and-jira-tracker.md:3166:\t\tfmt.Fprintf(stderr, \"missing custom field: %s (run `hivedispatch init -jira`)\\n\", f)\ndocs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-19-phase-0-1-bootstrap-and-jira-tracker.md:3169:\t\tfmt.Fprintf(stderr, \"missing workflow status: %q (see docs/jira-setup.md)\\n\", s)\ndocs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-19-phase-0-1-bootstrap-and-jira-tracker.md:3177:func runInit(args []string, stdout, stderr io.Writer) int {\ndocs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-19-phase-0-1-bootstrap-and-jira-tracker.md:3179:\tfs.SetOutput(stderr)\ndocs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-19-phase-0-1-bootstrap-and-jira-tracker.md:3186:\t\tfmt.Fprintln(stderr, \"init: nothing to do (pass -jira)\")\ndocs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-19-phase-0-1-bootstrap-and-jira-tracker.md:3191:\t\tfmt.Fprintln(stderr, err)\ndocs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-19-phase-0-1-bootstrap-and-jira-tracker.md:3196:\t\tfmt.Fprintln(stderr, err)\ndocs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-19-phase-0-1-bootstrap-and-jira-tracker.md:3201:\t\tfmt.Fprintln(stderr, \"init failed:\", err)\ndocs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-19-phase-0-1-bootstrap-and-jira-tracker.md:3209:Update the `switch` so `case \"init\": return runInit(args[1:], stdout, stderr)`, add imports `context` and `github.com/thomasmeadows/hivedispatch/internal/tracker/jira`, and update `usage`:\ndocs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-19-phase-2-dispatcher-with-fakes.md:1776:func (d *Dispatcher) Once(ctx) (handled int, err error)\ndocs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-19-phase-2-dispatcher-with-fakes.md:2253:\thandled := 0\ndocs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-19-phase-2-dispatcher-with-fakes.md:2262:\t\t\td.log().Info(\"handled\", \"ticket\", t.Key, \"outcome\", out)\ndocs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-19-phase-2-dispatcher-with-fakes.md:2